relayit|80|IT Ticket System (Webhost main — http://192.168.50.217)
simplelogin|7777|Simple Login email alias manager (Pi5 Hub — http://simplelogin.localrepo.net:7777 / localrepo.net)
immich_server|2283|Immich Photo & Video Server (Webhost — http://192.168.50.217:2283)